## CHAPTER 2: USER INTERFACE, DUAL DESKTOP OVERLAY & THINKINGORB VISUALIZATION

### 2.1 Dual Window Desktop Overlay Architecture
IRIS features a dual-interface desktop overlay system powered by PyWebView:
1. Pinned Top-Center Mini Orb: A compact, roughly 1-centimeter floating circular widget pinned to the top-center edge of the screen. It stays always-on-top, reflects engine state via glowing cyan/purple pulses, and toggles the main interface on click.
2. Main Assistant Window (`main_window.html`): A floating, frameless desktop window with rounded glassmorphic borders (radius 20px, dark theme `#0A0F1D`), custom draggable title bar (`-webkit-app-region: drag`), animated ThinkingOrb canvas, live biometric/vision telemetry HUD, quick-action prompt chips, and a scrollable chat thread.

### 2.2 The ThinkingOrb Generative Canvas Engine
The visual centerpiece of IRIS is the ThinkingOrb, rendered in real time on an HTML5 2D canvas (`#blob-canvas`, dimension 160x160 with device pixel ratio scaling):
- Mathematical Architecture: Derived from Jakub Antalik / HorizonX algorithmic orb principles, utilizing mathematical Fibonacci sphere projection (`fibDir`), 3D trigonometric coordinate transformations (`makeProj`), and depth sorting.
- Dynamic States and Colors:
  - Idle / Composing Mode: Cyan glowing ribbon frame (`#00F0FF`, 0.09-0.4 alpha, 130 ghost particles, multi-lane sinusoidal waving bands). Represents ready standby.
  - Hearing / Listening Mode: Emerald green pulsating wave (`#10B981`) triggered automatically whenever user voice activity is detected.
  - Thinking & Reasoning Mode: Deep royal purple orbiting sphere (`#A855F7`) active during LLM inference and step planning.
  - Speaking Mode: Soft blue glowing orbital expansion (`#38BDF8`) synchronized with voice playback.

### 2.3 Live Telemetry HUD (Heads-Up Display)
Directly beneath the ThinkingOrb canvas sits the live status telemetry HUD:
- `🎙️ MIC: LIVE / MUTED`: Shows microphone status; clickable to mute or unmute continuous listening.
- `👁️ VISION: LIVE`: Indicates camera and screen background sentinel status.
- `👤 User: [Name]`: Displays biometric identification (identifies Commander or triggers enrollment).
- `😊 Emotion Tag`: Reflects detected emotional state (Happy, Sad, Neutral, Angry, Surprised, Focused).
- `🖥️ Screen Tag`: Displays the title of the active foreground Windows window in real time.
- Quick Vision Buttons: Dedicated `👁️ See Screen` and `📷 See Camera` buttons for instant visual inspection.

